<title>USA: AmTrust Capital Corp sets initial dividend.</title>
<headline>AmTrust Capital Corp sets initial dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PERU, Ind. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmTrust Capital Corp said Friday it has declared its initial quarterly dividend, at $0.05 a share.  </p>
<p>The dividend will be payable February 17 to shareholders of record February 3, the company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
